WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:03.127
Why would an agent forget what it just did,

2
00:00:03.127 --> 00:00:05.227
when its logs look normal?

3
00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:07.013
It's a category error,

4
00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:09.273
because agents run three memory types,

5
00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:11.253
working memory for the current turn,

6
00:00:11.253 --> 00:00:12.813
episodic for what happened,

7
00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:14.813
and semantic for what's true.

8
00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:17.413
An agent kept events in semantic memory,

9
00:00:17.413 --> 00:00:23.593
so asking what changed in the last hour returned config edits ranked by topic, not time.

10
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.500
So I'd route facts to a semantic store,

11
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.960
and events to an episodic store fetched by time.

12
00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:31.687
When it contradicts itself,

13
00:00:31.687 --> 00:00:33.767
I'd investigate episodic ranking,

14
00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.687
and when it's confidently wrong,

15
00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:37.507
I'd update the knowledge base.
